sequenceDiagram
  participant P as Portal / Partner
  participant M as MCP server.py
  participant T as TaskBoard
  participant J as run_submit jobs.py
  participant W as Port quotient/port.py
  participant Q as loop/quality.run

  P->>M: tools/call submit_meeting
  M->>T: create task working
  M->>J: asyncio.create_task
  J->>W: submit(subject, object_key, ...)
  W-->>J: meeting_id queued
  loop poll 0.25s
    J->>W: meeting(id, subject)
    W-->>J: status working / progress
    J->>T: sync_task progress
  end
  W->>W: daemon thread _analyze
  W->>Q: run_quality
  Q-->>W: GateResult
  W->>W: _project ready|needs_review
  J->>W: meeting terminal
  J->>T: completed + result
  P->>M: tasks/result SSE until done
  P->>M: get_meeting / read_graph
